    "frameInterpolationResolutionTip" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "- In general, higher interpolation resolutions require more processing power.\n\n- Most devices with A15 or newer chips can interpolate 60 FPS to 120 FPS at the default interpolation resolution (around 720p).\nRecommended configurations for your reference:\niPhone 13 Pro (A15) - 1344 × 624\niPad Pro 2024 (M4) - 1440 × 992\n\n- Upgrade to iOS 27 to unlock interpolation resolutions above 720p.\n\n- If you experience increased input latency, stuttering, or other issues, lower the interpolation resolution.\n\n- There is always a setting that balances image quality and performance for stable frame interpolation.\n\n- Older models may not be able to initiate the interpolator(such as A12 SoC devices)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "- 一般而言，插帧分辨率越大，性能开销越大。\n\n- 大多数搭载 A15 或更新芯片的设备，可以在默认插帧分辨率(720p左右)下实现 60→120 FPS 插帧。\n以下配置供您参考:\niPhone 13 Pro (A15) - 1344 × 624\niPad Pro 2024 (M4) - 1440 × 992\n\n- 如需解锁超过 720p 的插帧分辨率，请升级至 iOS 27。\n\n- 若出现操作延迟增大、卡顿等异常现象，请降低插帧分辨率。\n\n- 总有一个能够平衡画质与性能的档位，可以实现稳定插帧。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "- 一般而言，影格插補解析度越高，效能負載越大。\n\n- 多數搭載 A15 或更新晶片的裝置，可在預設影格插補解析度(720p左右)下實現 60→120 FPS 影格插補。\n以下配置供您参考:\niPhone 13 Pro (A15) - 1344 × 624\niPad Pro 2024 (M4) - 1440 × 992\n\n- 如需解鎖超過 720p 的影格插補解析度，請升級至 iOS 27。\n\n- 若出現操作延遲增加、卡頓等異常情況，請降低影格插補解析度。\n\n- 總能找到一個兼顧畫質與效能的設定，以穩定進行影格插補。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "- 一般而言，影格插補解析度越高，效能負載越大。\n\n- 多數搭載 A15 或更新晶片的裝置，可在預設影格插補解析度(720p左右)下實現 60→120 FPS 影格插補。\n以下配置供您参考:\niPhone 13 Pro (A15) - 1344 × 624\niPad Pro 2024 (M4) - 1440 × 992\n\n- 如需解鎖超過 720p 的影格插補解析度，請升級至 iOS 27。\n\n- 若出現操作延遲增加、卡頓等異常情況，請降低影格插補解析度。\n\n- 總能找到一個兼顧畫質與效能的設定，以穩定進行影格插補。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "framePacingStackTip" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "- Off = no frame pacing, previously “Lowest Latency”.\n\n- Legacy, previously “Smoothest Video” (though it’s not the smoothest option anymore)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "- 关闭 = 无帧步进控制，即为moonlight的“最低延迟”.\n\n- 传统模式，相当于之前的“最高流畅度” (尽管已经不是最流畅的选项)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "- 關閉 = 無影格步調控制，即為之前的“最低延遲”。\n\n- 傳統模式，相當於之前的“最高流暢度”（儘管已經不是最流暢的選項）。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK" : {
